WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.400
Choose Pen and turn on Smart Draw.

00:01.400 --> 00:03.633
Draw around Draft on the live desktop. Release to straighten the shape.

00:03.633 --> 00:05.733
Choose Ellipse and mark Review.

00:05.733 --> 00:07.900
Add an arrow between the steps.

00:07.900 --> 00:10.067
Curve the arrow. Change its end and width.

00:10.067 --> 00:13.550
Select, move and resize. Undo the last change.

00:13.550 --> 00:15.700
Return to your apps. The annotations stay visible.
